A fast player over music you already own. Point it at a folder and it
builds your library, mixes, and recommendations entirely from what's there.
It's built to work the same way on a phone as it does on a desktop: same
layout, same keyboard-free navigation, same library, meant to scale to
thousands of tracks even on mobile.

